coder › Done on branch `work/done-command` (3 commits on top of `work/main`).

What changed:
- `src/store.ts`: `render` now shows `'<id>. [x] <text>'` for done todos and `'<id>. [ ] <text>'` for the rest; added `markDone(todos, id)` which returns a new list with that todo spread-copied to `done: true` (input list untouched) and throws `RangeError('no todo with id <id>')` when no todo has that id.
- `src/cli.ts`: added `done <id>` — parses with `Number` + `Number.isInteger` (blank counts as invalid), calls `markDone`, prints `done: <text>` with code 0; on non-whole-number or unknown id prints `error: no todo with id <raw>` with code 1 and returns the original `todos` unchanged. Usage line updated to `usage: todo add <text> | list | done <id>`.
- `src/store.test.ts` (new) and `src/cli.test.ts` (extended): tests for markDone success, non-mutation, RangeError naming the id; and for `done` success + `[x]` in list, `[ ]` for pending, unknown-id and non-numeric-id error shape/code/todos-unchanged.

